{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "4cad0f2b-4ac2-8929-8197-a71c187d5024",
  "created_at": "2025-12-09T12:24:03-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Recreation",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Brendan Sullivan",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Beth Almeida",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T12:21:33-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Recreation department, this is Beth, how can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T12:21:38-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hi Beth! Yeah, hi, I'm calling about pickleball? Like, what times do you guys have it at the gym?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T12:21:46-05:00",
      "duration": 17,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure thing. Hang on one second, let me pull up the winter schedule. Okay, so right now there's open play on weekday mornings and then again a couple evenings a week. Tuesdays and Thursdays are the evening ones, I believe, early evening into the night."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T12:22:03-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh nice, totally, that works. Sorry, if it's kind of noisy, I'm in an electrician's van right now? My partner's driving, so I'm just like, riding shotgun making calls."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T12:22:14-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No worries, a productive ride. I can hear you fine."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T12:22:19-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Awesome. So, um, is there like an age limit? For the pickleball? Because I'm in my seventies, so I don't know if it's like a younger crowd thing?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T12:22:30-05:00",
      "duration": 17,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh, not at all. It's open to adults, and honestly a lot of the regulars are in their sixties and seventies. There's a minimum age for the younger folks, teenagers need to check in with us first, but there's no upper limit. You'd fit right in."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T12:22:47-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, that's like, so good to hear? I was kind of nervous it'd be all, you know, twenty-somethings."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T12:22:54-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Nope, it's a good mix. Bring a paddle if you have one. They usually have a few loaners, but I can't promise there'll be any on a busy night."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T12:23:05-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Gotcha. And is the gym okay after that nor'easter? Like, the one that ended Saturday? I heard some places got messy."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T12:23:14-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "The gym's open and running as normal this week, as far as I know. If anything changes, we'd post it on the city site and at the front desk."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T12:23:25-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Perfect, perfect. So do I need to sign up, or just show up?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T12:23:31-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Just show up, you'll sign in at the desk when you get there. If you want, I can take your number and have someone call you if the schedule shifts for a holiday."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T12:23:44-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh, yeah, that'd be great. It's 401-555-0183."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T12:23:48-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it, 401-555-0183, and the name?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T12:23:51-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Brendan Sullivan. Two L's in Sullivan, like, S-U-L-L-I-V-A-N."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T12:23:55-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Perfect, Brendan, you're all set. Enjoy the games!"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T12:23:59-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thanks so much, Beth, you're the best! Okay, bye!"
    }
  ],
